                "text": "Publish an SPF record for ledgerwell.example",
                "why": "Your spoof already failed SPF and was delivered. SPF only reports the failure; the DMARC policy decides what happens to it, and that's still p=none." },
              { "id": "banner_dmarc_enforce", "correct": true,
                "text": "Add an external-sender banner and move DMARC to enforcement",
                "why": "Quarantine or reject stops the spoof at the gateway. The banner covers look-alike domains that DMARC can't catch." }
